---
// Static price-ceiling diagram: the shaded triangle contains the trades that
// would occur at equilibrium but do not occur when supply is limited to Q_s.
import CartesianGraph from "./primitives/cartesian-graph.astro";
---

<CartesianGraph
  captionSlot
  title="Deadweight Loss From a Price Ceiling"
  desc="A binding price ceiling limits trade to quantity Q sub s. The shaded triangle between the demand and supply curves, from Q sub s to the equilibrium quantity Q star, is deadweight loss."
  y={{ label: "Price", domain: [0, 10] }}
  x={{ label: "Quantity", domain: [0, 10] }}
  areas={[
    {
      points: [
        { x: 3.15, y: 3.52 },
        { x: 3.15, y: 6.65 },
        { x: 5.09, y: 5 },
      ],
      tone: "pt",
      opacity: 0.18,
    },
  ]}
  curves={[
    {
      equation: (quantity) => 9.33 - 0.853 * quantity,
      domain: [0.74, 9.41],
      tone: "s5",
      label: "D",
      labelAt: 9.41,
      labelDx: 5,
      labelDy: 5,
    },
    {
      equation: (quantity) => 1.1 + 0.768 * quantity,
      domain: [0.74, 9.41],
      tone: "ct",
      label: "S",
      labelAt: 9.41,
      labelDx: 5,
    },
  ]}
  lines={[
    {
      from: { x: 0, y: 3.52 },
      to: { x: 9.41, y: 3.52 },
      tone: "key",
      dashed: true,
      width: 2,
    },
    {
      from: { x: 0, y: 6.65 },
      to: { x: 3.15, y: 6.65 },
      guide: true,
    },
    {
      from: { x: 0, y: 3.52 },
      to: { x: 3.15, y: 3.52 },
      guide: true,
    },
    {
      from: { x: 3.15, y: 3.52 },
      to: { x: 3.15, y: 0 },
      guide: true,
    },
  ]}
  points={[
    {
      x: 5.09,
      y: 5,
      tone: "pt",
      guides: true,
    },
  ]}
  labels={[
    { text: "P_d", x: 0, y: 6.65, anchor: "end", dx: -8, dy: 4 },
    { text: "P*", x: 0, y: 5, anchor: "end", dx: -8, dy: 4 },
    { text: "P_c", x: 0, y: 3.52, anchor: "end", dx: -8, dy: 4 },
    { text: "Q_s", x: 3.15, y: 0, anchor: "middle", dy: 16 },
    { text: "Q*", x: 5.09, y: 0, anchor: "middle", dy: 16 },
    {
      text: "Price ceiling",
      x: 6.91,
      y: 3.52,
      tone: "key",
      dy: -7,
      weight: 600,
    },
    { text: "DWL", x: 3.56, y: 5.07, tone: "pt", size: 13, weight: 600 },
  ]}
>
  <Fragment slot="caption">
    The <span class="tone-pt">shaded triangle</span> is the deadweight loss. The
    price ceiling <span class="tone-key">P&#832c;</span> limits trade to
    <span class="tone-pt">Q&#832s;</span>, below the equilibrium quantity
    <span class="tone-pt">Q*</span>.
  </Fragment>
</CartesianGraph>
